{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"agent_message","text":"Explicit hipBLASLt selection is the useful lever: the best supported algorithms are around 37–40 µs for `M≤32` versus PyTorch’s 55–58 µs, and 8–13% faster at the mid/large shapes. I’m now selecting from all 899 valid algorithms for each exact `M`, then I’ll install that dispatch table and verify its numerical behavior end to end."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 python - <<'PY'\nimport torch, aiter, statistics, time\nN,K=28672,4096\nsmall=[256,248,240,232,224,216,208,200,192,184,176,168,160,152,144,136,128,120,112,104,96,88,80,72,64,56,48,40,32,24,16,8,4,2,1,7,35,70,15]\nB=torch.randn((N,K),device='cuda',dtype=torch.float16)\naiter.hipb_create_extension()\nP=torch.randn((16,K),device='cuda',dtype=torch.float16)\nsols=aiter.hipb_findallsols(P,B.T)\nprint('Nsols',len(sols),flush=True)\n\ndef timing(fn,reps):\n s=torch.cuda.Event(enable_timing=True); e=torch.cuda.Event(enable_timing=True)\n s.record()\n for _ in range(reps): fn()\n e.record(); e.synchronize()\n return s.elapsed_time(e)/reps\n\nmapping={}\nfor M in small:\n A=torch.randn((M,K),device='cuda',dtype=torch.float16)\n for _ in range(3): torch.matmul(A,B.T)\n torch.cuda.synchronize()\n base=timing(lambda:torch.matmul(A,B.T),10)\n coarse=[]\n for sol in sols:\n  try:\n   ms=timing(lambda sol=sol:aiter.hipb_mm(A,B.T,sol),4)\n   coarse.append((ms,sol))\n  except Exception:\n   pass\n coarse.sort()\n candidates=[sol for _,sol in coarse[:40]]\n refined=[]\n for sol in candidates:\n  ts=[timing(lambda sol=sol:aiter.hipb_mm(A,B.T,sol),20) for _ in range(3)]\n  refined.append((statistics.median(ts),min(ts),sol))\n refined.sort()\n med,best,win=refined[0]\n mapping[M]=win\n top=' '.join(f'{s}:{m:.4f}' for m,b,s in refined[:5])\n print(f'M={M:4d} torch={base:.4f} win={win} med={med:.4f} speed={base/med:.3f} top {top}',flush=True)\nprint('MAPPING',mapping,flush=True)\naiter.hipb_destroy_extension()\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
